{"v":4,"catch":"銀河戰士：你將駕駛哪台機甲？你將揮舞哪種武器？","desc":"《GALACTIC WARRIORS》是KONAMI於1985年推出的格鬥遊戲。\n加入宇宙紀元HIT 30,000年間席捲銀河人類的「機器人格鬥」盛事，邁向勝利之路。\n你的主角是三台備受喜愛的機器：SAMSON、GAEA與POSEIDON。\n宇宙戰士們在競技場上咆哮奔馳！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-11-13","genres":["街機","格鬥"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21f37e3cca856e3af8d028c2df09626b119df1d2d423bf8843b48d2f30b7e4d6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/98a6f0d4d2e378d33c3e2b3580c084da93e537b0abc0d471720013674440f613.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/87c896d077bce7c86363df39452761c2b1ebdf82eb954ec74dde698da0791960.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/024936e44b24c79808bd0dd8af0c4fc471b56f06f87836d22c3a9bb416decfbf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0540c8f998400b0f897772c3444bfeca90b93102d93953013347127230a05b49.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0170ef4c17ed8d188056dc1d48c884e9e66c712657419261368fb63cc2b620a1.jpg"],"titleId":"01009a80258be000","dlc":[]}